# `moy demo` / `moy port` working artifacts. celeste.moy is CC BY-NC-SA
# (Maddy Thorson & Noel Berry) -- it must never be committed or shipped in
# this repo; the demo command regenerates it locally from the BBS cart.
celeste.moy/
*.p8
*.p8.png

# ...but this repository's OWN p8 fixtures are source, not somebody's cart, and
# `make p8-test` cannot run without them. They passed locally and failed on CI
# for two weeks because the rule above is silent about what it swallows.
!libmoy/test/*.p8

__pycache__/
.idea/
.vscode/

# `moy export` output bundles
*-web/

# The generated site (site/build.py). CI builds it from the canonical sources
# on every push -- a checked-in copy could only ever be stale.
_site/

# Claude Code's local config -- not part of the spec.
.claude/
.pmem
